ing` annotation with path parameter\n   - Follows the repository pattern with `findById()` → throw if null\n   - Implements status-specific behavior with `when` expression\n   - Uses `copy()` for immutable state transition\n   - Calls `repository.save()` for persistence\n   - Returns shipment object (appropriate for REST)\n   This was necessary to implement the requirement.\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 new test methods:\n   - `confirms a created shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED status` - Tests CREATED → CONFIRMED transition\n   - `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change` - Tests idempotence\n   - `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict error` - Tests 409 response for CANCELLED\n   - `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error` - Tests 404 response for missing\n   All tests follow existing patterns (MockMvc, jsonPath assertions, status codes). These were necessary per requirements.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements are implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm to transition shipments from CREATED to CONFIRMED with idempotent behavior, 409 for CANCELLED, 404 for missing.\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt - added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED error code to distinguish CANCELLED rejection\n              ShipmentController.kt - added confirm() endpoint with status-based routing (CREATED→CONFIRMED, CONFIRMED→no-op, CANCELLED→409)\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt - added 4 tests covering CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotence, CANCELLED rejection, and 404 for missing\n\nTests         - confirms a created shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED status (CREATED → CONFIRMED path)\n              - confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change (idempotence)\n              - rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict error (CANCELLED → 409 path)\n              - rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error (missing → 404 path)\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw clean test in sample-service/\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS - 17 tests passed (9 ShipmentControllerTest, 4 OrderControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests, 3 CustomerControllerTest), 0 failures\n\nNot done      Nothing - all acceptance criteria implemented, tested, and verified.\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3389,"cache_read_input_tokens":23324,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3389},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"160d4e53-d914-4f06-918a-a9ec2d220f91","uuid":"c3167fd5-4faf-4e87-8171-a94bb79e62b8","timestamp":"2026-09-30T12:05:09.679Z","request_id":"req_011CfZbMVpcXskm1DA5oPizv"}
